Viktor's screenshots of SUNO v6, 09.10.2026 («Наша студия уже круче, чем СУНО»): its Fade in beside our End at….

The engine: the request's fade_in (0 to 30 s, checked with fade_out): the take's first seconds brought up from silence on a half cosine (audio_fade_in, fade_out's mirror), after the decoding in both of the server's paths; written back into the replay request, so a Retake keeps it. The page: the take's Fade in… beside End at… asks the seconds (2 offered, a comma read as a point, 0.2 to 30 and not more than half the take) and replays the same take whole from its kept latents (else its music codes), titled «· fades in N s»; an ended take stays ended.

Suite: 587/0 in the kitchen; fade_in tried on real latents by an engine of its own on GPU2 before the studio was restarted.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
